%% Proposed architecture; not deployed in Phase 1
sequenceDiagram
 actor Visitor
 participant UI
 participant Booking
 participant DB
 participant Stripe as Stripe test mode
 Visitor->>UI: Tier, guests, date, slot
 UI->>Booking: JWT + command + idempotency key
 Booking->>DB: Validate price and write pending snapshot
 Booking->>Stripe: Create test checkout (idempotent)
 Stripe-->>UI: Test checkout URL
 Visitor->>Stripe: Test payment
 Stripe->>Booking: Signed webhook
 Booking->>Booking: Verify signature, amount, event ID
 Booking->>DB: Atomic confirm + outbox (once)
 UI->>Booking: Read own booking
 Booking-->>UI: Confirmed reference and signed QR
